    title: 'Youth Artist Guild Lubbock Performing Arts Season 2024-2025',
    description:
      'The Youth Artist Guild Lubbock Performing Arts 2024–2025 Season offers a lineup of family-friendly performances made possible in part by a grant from the City of Lubbock, as recommended by Civic Lubbock, Inc. The season kicks off with Heist Quest (Oct 18–20 & 25–27), where a rogue thief is hired to kidnap a princess but faces magical mishaps and a less-than-expert team. In How to Enchant a Bookshop (Dec 13–15), a fairy-in-training accidentally brings storybook characters to life while trying to save a struggling bookstore. The Westing Game (Feb 14–16 & 21–23) brings a thrilling mystery to the stage as residents of Sunset Towers unravel the clues behind a millionaire’s murder. Finally, The Jungle Book (Apr 25–27 & May 2–4) tells the adventurous tale of Mowgli, the boy raised by wolves, as he navigates the wild and faces the fearsome Shere Khan. For more details, visit www.yaglubbock.org.',
