    startTime: '2025-05-29T23:00:00.000Z',
    endTime: '2025-08-22T02:00:00.000Z',
    timezone: 'CDT',
    description:
      '<div class="xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs">LIVE MUSIC NIGHTS</div> \r\n <div class="x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s">McPherson Cellars Presents: Live Music Nights<span class="html-span xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs x3nfvp2 x1j61x8r x1fcty0u xdj266r xat24cr xgzva0m xhhsvwb xxymvpz xlup9mm x1kky2od"><img height="16" width="16" alt="🌙" class="xz74otr x168nmei x13lgxp2 x5pf9jr xo71vjh" referrerpolicy="origin-when-cross-origin" src="https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t33/1/16/1f319.png"></span><span class="html-span xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs x3nfvp2 x1j61x8r x1fcty0u xdj266r xat24cr xgzva0m xhhsvwb xxymvpz xlup9mm x1kky2od"><img height="16" width="16" alt="🎉" class="xz74otr x168nmei x13lgxp2 x5pf9jr xo71vjh" referrerpolicy="origin-when-cross-origin" src="https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t8c/1/16/1f389.png"></span> Join us every other Thursday from 6–9PM, May through August, for an evening of great tunes, tasty wine, and good company. Inspired by our popular Patio Nights, these events will feature live performances by local musicians, discounted wines by the glass, and a tasty food truck lineup.</div> \r\n <div class="x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s">While our beautiful courtyard will be open, music and seating will be indoors in our Event Center—perfect for staying comfortable no matter what the West Texas weather brings!</div> \r\n <div class="x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s">2025 Live Music Night Schedule</div> \r\n <div class="x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s">May 1st: \'806 Duo\' Bo Garza &amp; Jake Pyeatt, Llano Cubano</div> \r\n <div class="x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s">May 15th: D.G. Flewellyn, Lonestar Mac Dough Food Truck</div> \r\n <div class="x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s">May 29th: Jeremy Couture, Mijo\'s Food Truck</div> \r\n <div class="x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s">June 12th: Jere Lowe, Rolling Wood Fire Pizza</div> \r\n <div class="x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s">June 26th: Mark Wallney, Food Truck TBD</div> \r\n <div class="x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s">July 10th: Anthony Garcia &amp; Friends, Llano Cubano</div> \r\n <div class="x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s">July 24th: Jenni Dale Lord, Nirvana Burger</div> \r\n <div class="x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s">August 7th: Philip Coggins, Mijo\'s Food Truck</div> \r\n <div class="x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s">August 21st: Spivey, Crusty\'s Woodfire Pizza <div class="x1i10hfl xjbqb8w x1ejq31n xd10rxx x1sy0etr x17r0tee x972fbf xcfux6l x1qhh985 xm0m39n x9f619 x1ypdohk xt0psk2 xe8uvvx xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x16tdsg8 x1hl2dhg xggy1nq x1a2a7pz xkrqix3 x1sur9pj xzsf02u x1s688f" role="button" tabindex="0"></div> \r\n </div> \r\n ',
