    id: '28e35739-b6f8-5aa7-0906-e382912d6a64',
    name: '81st D-Day Commemoration at the Silent Wings Museum',
    title: '81st D-Day Commemoration at the Silent Wings Museum',
    startTime: '2025-06-07T15:00:00.000Z',
    endTime: '2025-06-08T22:00:00.000Z',
    timezone: 'CDT',
    description:
      'Join the Silent Wings Museum as it commemorates the anniversary of the Normandy Invasion, honoring the service and sacrifice of the Glider Pilots who flew unarmed gliders into enemy landing zones during D-Day. This event pays tribute to the brave men who piloted these missions and the troops they carried into combat. Visitors can view vintage aircraft, hear firsthand accounts from Glider Pilots, and explore the unique story of the CG-4A glider. The event takes place on Saturday, June 7, and Sunday, June 8, 2025, from 10 AM to 5 PM both days, with free admission. Activities include vintage aircraft and vehicles displays, living history presentations, and educational activities throughout the day.',
