      'The Turnpike Troubadours are bringing their Wild America Tour to the Outdoor Stage at Cook’s Garage, featuring special guests Shane Smith and the Saints and Lance Roark. This is an outdoor concert that will take place rain or shine, so come prepared for the weather. All ticket sales are final—there will be no refunds—so make sure you’re ready for a night of unforgettable music. For everyone’s safety, a clear bag policy is in effect, and no re-entry will be allowed once you leave the venue. Weapons of any kind, including pocket knives, are strictly prohibited. Attendees are welcome to bring lawn chairs for comfortable seating (remove them from their bags at security), but note that they are not permitted in some premium areas, so check your ticket details. While no outside food or drinks are allowed, a wide variety of concessions will be available on site. Please also note that professional photography equipment is not permitted without prior approval. Pets are not allowed, so leave your furry friends at home. Be sure to check the official event page for updates, parking details, and additional info. Supporting acts are subject to change.',
